OL,3,GNEWSARyanair passenger says bomb threat
OL,4,Awas 'traumatic'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe evacuation of a Ryanair aircraft
OL,7,Fafter a suspected bomb threat has been
OL,8,Fdescribed as "quite traumatic" by a
OL,9,Fpassenger who was on board the flight.
OL,11,FSarah Jones said police, fire crews and
OL,12,Fbomb disposal officers surrounded the
OL,13,Fplane after it landed at Murcia airport
OL,14,Ffrom Manchester.
OL,16,FThe medic from Manchester said she and
OL,17,Fher fellow passengers were told to
OL,18,Fleave their belongings on board and
OL,19,Fthen spent about three hours in an
OL,20,Fairport hangar while the plane was
OL,21,Fsearched.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
