OL,3,GNEWSARyanair passenger says bomb threat
OL,4,Awas 'traumatic'
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpanish officials said no explosives
OL,7,Fwere found. The aircraft was one of
OL,8,Fseven searched at airports across
OL,9,FEurope following a series of suspected
OL,10,Fbomb threats.
